<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6971" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Castălĭa</span></b> , ae,
			f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κασταλία</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a fountain on
			Parnassus</i>, <i>sacred to Apollo and the Muses</i>,
			Liv. Andron. ap. <i><span class="en">Fest. p. 310</span></i>, b Müll.;
				<i><span class="en">Verg.
				G. 3, 293</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Hor. C. 3, 4, 61</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Stat. Th. 1,
				698</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> Hence the <i>adjj.</i>, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Castă-lĭus</span></b> , a, um, <i>Castalian</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fons,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin. 4,
					3, 4, § 8</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Sen. Oedip. 229</span></i>; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fontes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Stat.
					Th. 1, 565</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">arbor,</span>”
				<i>the laurel</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Prop.
				3</span></i>
			 (4), 3, 13; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">hence, umbra,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tib.
					3, 1, 16</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">antrum,</span>”
				i. e. <i>the cave of the oracle at Delphi</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					3, 14</span></i>
			.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Castălis</span></b> ,
				ĭdis, f., <i>Castalian</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">unda,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart.
					9, 19 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sorores,</span>”
				i. e. <i>the Muses</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id. 4,
					14</span></i>
			; also as <i>subst.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Castalidum grex,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					7, 12, 10</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
